{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>皇崗口岸下午2時起過關返港人流明顯增加，自助閘門及人工櫃枱幾乎全部開放，過關不需要排隊很久。本台記者早前經皇崗口岸返港，半分鐘就可以過關，過程暢順。</p><p></p><p>入境處提醒下午至晚上是入境高峰。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T08:59:40.909428+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":91,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T08:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T08:57:43.117232+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T08:57:43.117232+00:00","content_hash":"2943d2757d26927f03a9e8c10da6c7a725ec3c457640c12ddf9f9616a3a0b8b6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}